7. GROK FILTER
====================================================================

Purpose

Convert raw logs into structured fields.

Raw Log

↓

Structured JSON

Common Patterns

%{IP}

%{USERNAME}

%{HOSTNAME}

%{NUMBER}

%{WORD}

%{DATA}

%{GREEDYDATA}

%{SYSLOGTIMESTAMP}

Golden Rule

Observe log first.

Then write Grok Pattern.

Never memorize blindly.

